Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?SourbyCraft=20v9.18=20ownerPlugin=20helper=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20fix=20getPlugins()[0]=20crash=20+=20/sys=20wildstac?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ker=20line?=
